rvices (which provides 1-on-1 advising for all aspects of pre-health, as well as detailed information regarding course planning), URAF (Undergraduate Research and Fellowships), concentration advisers, house tutors, Pre-Med Peer Liaisons (PPL PAFs) and more. Click the links below to check out some of these great resources at Harvard and make sure to join our mailing list for information about events and more organized by these programs.","claimId":"01a0f266-7708-7fd2-bd87-33feea13de61","badge":"verified","confidence":0,"assertionKind":"stated","bestTier":0,"observedAt":"2026-10-02T20:48:33.654Z","asOf":null,"stale":false,"sources":[{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://hups.site/about/team","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-10-02T20:48:33.654Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://hups.site/about","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-10-02T20:48:31.365Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://hups.site/home","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-10-02T20:48:26.738Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://harvardpremed.com/about/team","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-09-30T12:59:43.418Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://harvardpremed.com/about","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-09-30T12:59:41.152Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://harvardpremed.com/home","title":"Harvard Undergraduate Premedical Society | HUPS","observedAt":"2026-09-30T12:59:36.652Z","isFixture":false,"quote":null},{"sourceId":"","sourceType":"club_website","url":"https://hups.site","title":"Harvard Undergraduate